"            ┌ Where is your setup engine? ─────────────────────────────────────────────┐            "
"            │macsetup drives a setup engine: a repo with an executable `setup`         │            "
"            │at its root. None was found via --repo, $MACSETUP_REPO, config.toml       │            "
"            │or chezmoi.                                                               │            "
"            │                                                                          │            "
"            │Type the path of the engine repo and press Enter to save it to            │            "
"            │~/.config/macsetup/config.toml                                            │            "
"            │                                                                          │            "
"            │Path: ~/nowhere▏                                                          │            "
